\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Highest-degree nodes of the definitions network on the LCC 2-core. Concept degree counts the 2-core definitions that contain the concept; definition degree counts the 2-core concepts the definition contains. The last two columns rank definitions by degree per 10 words of quotation, using the English translation where one exists. Per-word rankings favor short quotations; across the 171 definitions the per-word value correlates $-0.23$ with word count. Ties at the cutoff are included.\relax }}{4}{table.caption.3}\protected@file@percent }
